{"id":"n83634-2-9","stage":5,"title":"풀어내다 · 解开","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n83634-2-9-1","ko":"민준이는 정말 똑똑한 것 같아.","zh":"敏俊看起来真的很聪明呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준이는","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"민준이는","audio":"/audio/068c382ba3282b86786d.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61174","senseId":"1","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"똑똑한","meaning":"聪慧","explanation":"똑똑하다：聪慧；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"똑똑하다","audio":"/audio/93e0c2c63740f5689814.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15186","senseId":"2","lemma":"똑똑하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61174","definition":"没有虚假而真正地。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"93e0c2c63740f568","term":"똑똑하다","zh":"聪慧","audio":"/audio/93e0c2c63740f5689814.mp3","entryId":"15186","definition":"聪明伶俐。","pronunciation":["똑또카다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/92a15f70082aa6a3c53c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n83634-2-9-2","ko":"응, 그 어려운 문제를 술술 풀어내더라니까.","zh":"对，那道很难的题他居然一下子就解出来了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그","meaning":"那个","explanation":"그：那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43883","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어려운","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제를","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"술술","meaning":"徐徐地","explanation":"술술：徐徐地","readings":[{"term":"술술","audio":"/audio/34fa974eeb08947c1d6c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69509","senseId":"6","lemma":"술술","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"풀어내더라니까.","meaning":"解开，解出","explanation":"풀어내다：解开，解出；더라니까：强调自己亲身发现的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"풀어내다","audio":"/audio/ab110b7a2286faab55e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83634","senseId":"2","lemma":"풀어내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"43883","definition":"指代前面已经讲过的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":